{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52262","headline":"诗（幷序） 二十三 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 二十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寺内数个尼，各各事威仪。\n本是俗人女，出家挂佛衣。\n徒衆数十个，诠择补[纲]（刚）维。\n一一依佛教，五事总合知。\n莫看他破戒，身自牢住持。\n佛殿元不识，损（一作「捐」）坏法与衣。\n常住无贮积，家人受寒饥。\n衆厨空安竈，粗饭当房𠯈（项校作「吹」，爲「炊」音讹）\n只求多财富（一作「宝」），余事且随宜。\n富者相过重，贫者往还稀。\n但知一日乐，忘却百年饥。\n不采生缘瘦，唯愿当身肥。\n今多损却宝，来年更若爲？\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52262.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52262","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}